OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Crazy' texts sent before elderly
OL,4,Amum's death, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence at Oxford Crown Court,
OL,7,FJeremy Mogford said his sister was
OL,8,F"almost programmed to say ridiculous
OL,9,Fthings to shock", after jurors heard
OL,10,Fshe had sent messages including "I am
OL,11,Factually killing her".
OL,13,FThe pair deny attempted murder and
OL,14,Fmaintain they gave their mother
OL,15,Fmorphine only to relieve her pain.
